# Imported library

pip install reportlab
pip install reportlab pillow

# Create an executable file from the Python script using PyInstaller
pip install pyinstaller 
    pyinstaller --onefile "<script_name>.py" or python -m PyInstaller --onefile tnc_tests.py
    inside of the dist folder, you will find the executable file that can be run on any Windows machine without requiring Python to be installed.



